// Boss Enemy Groups Redefinition Script by Vittorio.

// Normally the game considers enemy groups 448 and higher as boss ones, using the boss swirl and fanfare for them.
// This script will let you define if each enemy group is a boss or normal one individually instead.

// <--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------->

